    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεκαθά:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκοῦσα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (Prob. Cret. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝέκαθθα &lt;
			ϝεκṇτ</span>-<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>y</i><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ.</span>) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέκαλον</span></b>  (i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝέκηλον</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">:
			ἥσυχον</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεκᾶσα</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ</span>
			=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝ</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">:
			ἑκοῦσα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γελαιώς:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ γέλως</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλαν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐγὴν ἡλίου</span>, Id. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝελ-</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴλη</span>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γελεῖν</span>.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γελανδρόν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχρόν</span>, Id.</div>
